    "final_answer": "I have successfully found the cheapest Samsung-made Android tablet with screen between 10-10.9 inches on Amazon.\n\n## Answer\n\nThe cheapest Samsung-made Android tablet with screen between 10-10.9 inches on Amazon is:\n\n**SAMSUNG Galaxy Tab S5e 4G LTE (64GB, 4GB) 10.5\" Cellular Android Tablet**\n- **Price**: $100.00 (or $99.99 with other sellers - \"Renewed from $99.99\")\n- **Brand**: Samsung\n- **Screen Size**: 10.5 inches (within the 10-10.9 inch range)\n- **Operating System**: Android 9 (upgradable to Android 11, One UI 3.1)\n- **Storage**: 64GB\n- **RAM**: 4GB\n- **Processor**: Qualcomm SDM670 Snapdragon 670 (Octa-core)\n- **Display Resolution**: 2560 x 1600 (WQXGA) Super AMOLED\n- **Condition**: Renewed (Refurbished - Good)\n- **Rating**: 4.8 out of 5 stars (15 reviews)\n\n**Verification method**: I navigated to Amazon.com, searched for \"Samsung Android tablet 10 inch\", then applied two filters:\n1. Display Size: \"10 to 10.9 Inches\"\n2. Brand: \"Samsung\"\n\nThen sorted the results by \"Price: Low to High\", and the SAMSUNG Galaxy Tab S5e appeared as the cheapest option at $100.00. I clicked through to the product page to confirm the specifications match all criteria (Samsung-made, Android OS, 10.5\" screen in the 10-10.9 inch range).\n\nNote: This is a Renewed/refurbished product. If you specifically need a new (non-refurbished) tablet, the cheapest new Samsung Android tablet in this size range would be different. Let me know if you'd like me to search specifically for new units.",
